---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: false
scene: true
description: John Carl Dimatulac builds systems that run operations — real-time tracking, scheduling engines, and scalable web infrastructure. Designed for execution, not presentation.
---

{# ============================================================ HERO ======= #}
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__grid-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  {% include "partials/systemmap.njk" %}

  <div class="shell hero__inner">
    <div class="hero__meta">
      <span class="label label--signal">{{ site.location }}</span>
      <span class="label label--faint">{{ site.role }}</span>
      <span class="label label--faint">Available for systems work</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="display">
      <span class="line-mask"><span data-hero-line>I Build Systems</span></span>
      <span class="line-mask"><span data-hero-line>That Run</span></span>
      <span class="line-mask"><span data-hero-line class="signal">Operations.</span></span>
    </h1>

    <div class="hero__body">
      <div class="hero__lede">
        <p class="lede">
          Web developer and automation engineer. I work on real-time systems,
          scheduling engines, and scalable web infrastructure &mdash; from
          concept to deployment.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="hero__aside">
        <p class="callout">
          I don&rsquo;t just build websites.<br>
          I design systems that handle operations.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="btn" href="/start/">
        Start a project <span class="btn__glyph" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span>
      </a>

      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/work/">
        See the work <span class="btn__glyph" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ========================================================== TICKER ====== #}
<div class="band">
  <div class="ticker" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="ticker__track">
      {% for pass in [1, 2] %}
        {% for word in ["Real-time tracking", "Workflow automation", "Dashboard architecture", "Scheduling engines", "API integration", "Internal platforms", "HRMS / LMS", "n8n + AI agents"] %}
          <span class="ticker__item">{{ word }}</span>
        {% endfor %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{# ====================================================== SELECTED WORK === #}
<section class="band section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="eyebrow">
      <span class="label">Selected builds</span>
      <span class="eyebrow__rule"></span>
      <span class="label label--plain label--faint">{{ builds.length }} systems</span>
    </div>

    <div class="work">
      {% for build in builds %}
        <a class="work__item" href="/work/" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="{{ loop.index0 * 60 }}">
          <span class="work__index">{{ loop.index0 | pad }}</span>

          <span>
            <span class="work__title">{{ build.title }}</span>
            <span class="work__tech work__meta">
              {% for t in build.tech %}<span class="tag">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}
            </span>
          </span>

          <span class="work__meta">
            <span class="work__desc">{{ build.desc }}</span>
          </span>

          <span class="work__glyph" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:2.5rem">
      <a class="link" href="/work/">
        View all builds <span class="btn__glyph" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span>
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{# ======================================================== WHAT I DO ===== #}
<section class="band section" style="border-top:1px solid var(--ink-14)">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="eyebrow">
      <span class="label">What I do</span>
      <span class="eyebrow__rule"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="split">
      <div class="split__lead">
        <h2 class="h2">Not websites. Systems that carry the day-to-day.</h2>
        <p class="body" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
          If your workflows are manual, fragmented, or held together by someone
          remembering to do them, those are system problems. I build the things
          that remove them.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top:2rem">
          <a class="link" href="/services/">
            All five services <span class="btn__glyph" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span>
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="split__body">
        <div class="cells">
          {% for s in services %}
            <a class="cell" href="/services/#{{ s.id }}" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="{{ loop.index0 * 70 }}">
              <span class="cell__num">{{ loop.index0 | pad }}</span>
              <div class="cell__title">{{ s.title }}</div>
              <p class="cell__desc">{{ s.outcome }}</p>
            </a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ================================================= METHOD + ANALYZER ==== #}
<section class="band band--dark section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="eyebrow">
      <span class="label">How I read a system</span>
      <span class="eyebrow__rule"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="split">
      <div class="split__lead">
        <h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
          Before I build anything, I map where the work actually breaks.
        </h2>
        <p class="lede">
          Five questions I ask of every operation I&rsquo;m brought into.
        </p>

        <div style="margin-top:2.5rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;align-items:flex-start">
          <a class="btn" href="/process/">How the work runs <span class="btn__glyph" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost" data-open-diagnostic>
            Run it on your site <span class="btn__glyph" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="split__body">
        <div class="chain">
          {% for step in method %}
            <div class="chain__step" data-status="{{ step.status }}"
                 data-reveal data-reveal-delay="{{ loop.index0 * 90 }}">
              <span class="chain__node" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <div class="chain__head">
                <div>
                  <span class="label label--plain label--faint">{{ loop.index0 | pad }}</span>
                  <div class="chain__title">{{ step.title }}</div>
                  <div class="chain__desc">{{ step.desc }}</div>
                </div>
                <span class="chip" data-status="{{ step.status }}">{{ step.status }}</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ========================================================== METRICS ===== #}
<section class="band section section--tight">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="stats">
      {% for stat in stats %}
        <div class="stat" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="{{ loop.index0 * 80 }}">
          <div class="stat__count">{{ stat.count }}</div>
          <div class="stat__title">{{ stat.title }}</div>
          <div class="stat__desc">{{ stat.desc }}</div>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ============================================================= CTA ====== #}
<section class="band band--dark section">
  <div class="shell" style="text-align:center">
    <h2 class="h1" style="max-width:18ch;margin-inline:auto">
      Start a system that actually runs your operations.
    </h2>
    <p class="lede" style="margin:1.75rem auto 2.5rem">
      From concept to deployment &mdash; designed for execution, not just
      presentation.
    </p>
    <a class="btn" href="/start/">
      Start a project <span class="btn__glyph" aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
